    <h1 class="section-title">How we meet UK GDPR, principle by principle.</h1>
    <p class="section-sub">This page goes alongside our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> and <a href="/security">security page</a> — this one maps what we actually do against each of the seven UK GDPR principles and the DPA 2018, for anyone (a DSL, a DPO, a governor) who needs the detail rather than the summary.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap prose">
